      "statement": "The qmd mcp command uses the stdio transport by default (startMcpServer); with --http it starts the Streamable HTTP server (startMcpHttpServer), and with --http --daemon it re-spawns that HTTP server as a detached child and records its PID in a pidfile that qmd mcp stop signals after an identity check.",
