      "id": "claim_c35f409670c74c9a802f3207519ca141",
      "statement": "The MCP instructions string is built per store by buildInstructions from index facts (document count, global context, collection names only, embedding status, search examples, and retrieval tips) and deliberately excludes metadata key rankings to avoid a scan on every initialize.",
