      "id": "claim_5439b46410514c848588b88fe0e659f9",
      "statement": "Built MCP instructions are cached in a WeakMap keyed by store for less than 60,000 ms; concurrent callers share the in-flight promise, a negative age (clock stepped back) forces a rebuild, and a failed build is removed from the cache so the next initialize retries.",
