      "id": "claim_ac200af34e724d17a8f600b6e60f9334",
      "statement": "Stdio shutdown on stdin end or close runs once, in this order: close the MCP server and transport, wait up to 5000 ms for in-flight handlers, skip the LLM disposal step, then attempt to close the store once; a throw from any step is caught and logged without retry, and it sets process.exitCode rather than calling process.exit.",
